  "description": "Princess Yuria and Duke Carlisle will kill anyone who crosses their path. But this is supposed to be a romance novel, not a thriller! Now here I am, transmigrated into the novel and married off to nine-year-old Carlisle years before he and Yuria kill me for coming between them. But all I can think about is how…adorable Carlisle is? What if I raised him to be kind? Once he’s a loving adult, I can just pretend to love someone else and run away before Yuria arrives...right?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61860682), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%BC%EB%B0%98%EB%8F%84%EC%A3%BC%EB%8A%94-%EC%8B%A0%EC%A4%91%ED%9E%88/3550)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://tapas.io/series/running-away-at-night/info), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/156767)",
